# Vocabulary used by examples/shop/mapping.ttl. Declaring property kinds lets
# Ontop reject a mapping that uses a data property for IRIs or vice versa.
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix ex: <http://example.org/> .

<http://example.org/shop> a owl:Ontology .

ex:Customer a owl:Class .
ex:Order a owl:Class .

ex:name a owl:DatatypeProperty .
ex:tier a owl:DatatypeProperty .
ex:amount a owl:DatatypeProperty .
ex:placedBy a owl:ObjectProperty .
